  "prefLabel": "Res 5302.10 Proof of Land Conversion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5302.10 Proof of Land Conversion. Proof of land conversion shall include stumping, stump grinding, seeding to establish cover other than trees and shrubs, or erecting a fence and pasturing livestock.\n\nSource. #8441, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10547, eff 3-21-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res5200-5900.html"
